      "writtenOn": "2026-10-24T11:08:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Confirmed with a packet regression on PS3: after 2,048 live Children / 4,096 IPsec SAs, the next CREATE_CHILD_SA returns SA rather than Notify. PS4 checks the tunnel-creation return, frees/removes the appended Child, and returns NO_ADDITIONAL_SAS without deleting the IKE SA or existing Children (RFC 7296 sections 1.3 and 2.21.3). The same regression passes under debug/ASAN, including retransmission, unchanged counts, and successful reuse after Delete.",
      "parentUuid": "50710e3f_c6d0d645",
      "revId": "45c21c7c71c770fcef9e44f604893e85914aa258",
